        "eyebrow": "Our Story",
        "heading": "Two Decades of Curation",
        "body": "<p>Founded in Melbourne in 2004, MARAIS began as a singular vision: to bring the world's most considered designers to Australian wardrobes. What started as a single boutique in South Yarra has grown into five locations and a global online presence.</p><p>We believe fashion is more than clothing — it is a form of self-expression, craft, and culture. Every brand we carry is chosen with intention. Every piece tells a story.</p>",
